llms=f'# {NAME}\n\n> Free plain-language guide for Canadian parents (BC first, plus every province and territory) of children with autism and other disabilities: funding programs, eligibility quiz, and a directory of AAC, sensory, safety tools and BC services. Amounts verified against official sources on 2026-10-14. Not legal advice.\n\n## Funding Guide\n'+''.join(f'- [{p["name"]}]({SITE}/funding/{p["slug"]}.html): {p["amount"]}\n' for p in P)+'## DTC Playbook\n- [Start here: how to apply]('+SITE+'/funding/dtc/index.html)\n- [Describe daily life with CRA criteria + parent prep sheet]('+SITE+'/funding/dtc/wording.html)\n- [Doctor fees in BC]('+SITE+'/funding/dtc/fees.html)\n- [Get your MP to help (RC161)]('+SITE+'/funding/dtc/mp-help.html)\n- [Back pay: up to 10 years, CDB arrears, RDSP carry-forward]('+SITE+'/funding/dtc/back-pay.html)\n\n'+'- [BC Autism Funding ends March 31, 2027: what replaces it]('+SITE+'/funding/autism-funding-2027.html): Disability Benefit $6,500 or up to $17,000/yr by need; Disability Supplement up to $6,000/yr income-tested from July 2027\n'+'\n## Provinces and territories\n- [Pick your province]('+SITE+'/provinces/index.html)\n'+''.join(f'- [{PROV[c]["name"]}]({SITE}/provinces/{c}/): '+'; '.join(x['nickname']+(' ('+x['amount']+')' if x['verified'] else ' (amount: check the official page)') for x in PROV[c]['programs'])+'\n' for c in provinces.ORDER)+'\n## Pages\n- [Eligibility quiz]('+SITE+'/quiz.html)\n- [FAQ]('+SITE+'/faq.html)\n- [Directory]('+SITE+'/directory/index.html), machine-readable: '+SITE+'/listings.json\n\n## Directory\n'+''.join(f'- [{l["name"]}]({SITE}/directory/{l["slug"]}.html): {l["category"]}; {l["region"]}; {l["description"]}\n' for l in L)
